            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marlene Ross"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Finally.... A really good dressing! I cut back the balsamic to 1/4 cup and added 1 TSP of crushed garlic, as some other reviewers recommended. Couldn't be any easier to make.",
            "datePublished": "2017-01-27T02:50:29.673Z"
