              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "naples34102"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Too much vinegar and Dijon as written. Back off on the vinegar to a ratio of 3:1 oil to vinegar, reduce Dijon to 1-2 teaspoons, and use only about half as much honey and this is perfect.",
